# Dragon Magazine Compendium - companion creatures for alternative class features (acf_build.py).

Plant Companion	KEY:Companion ~ Plant Companion (DMC)	SIZE:M	MOVE:Walk,30	FACE:5	REACH:5	LEGS:2	BONUS:STAT|STR|2	BONUS:STAT|CON|4	BONUS:STAT|INT|-8	BONUS:COMBAT|AC|3|TYPE=NaturalArmor	VISION:Low-Light Vision	ABILITY:FEAT|AUTOMATIC|Toughness	NATURALATTACKS:Slam,Weapon.Natural.Melee.Bludgeoning,*1,1d4	MONSTERCLASS:Plant:1	RACETYPE:Plant	TYPE:Plant	SOURCEPAGE:p.232	DESC:A druid's or ranger's plant companion (Dragon Magazine Compendium p.232): a roused sapling or bramble with mobility and a measure of free will. Base statistics: Medium plant, 1 HD, AC 13 (+3 natural), slam 1d4, Str 12 Dex 10 Con 14 Int 2 Wis 10 Cha 10, low-light vision, plant traits, Toughness; Hide +4 in its natural terrain. It advances as an animal companion; Handle Animal works on it without the -5 for non-animals. Its master evolves it instead of choosing stronger companions (natural selection - see the plant companion feature).
